<!doctype html><html lang="bn"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Bird ID — identify birds from photos with AI. Upload a bird image, get possible species, scientific name, confidence and identification clues."><title>Bird ID — AI Bird Identification</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui;margin:0;background:#f4f7f5;color:#16321f}.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px}.card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 35px #0001}.btn{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin:4px}.stripe{background:#176b35;color:#fff}.bkash{background:#e2136e;color:#fff}.link{display:inline-block;margin:10px 4px;color:#176b35;font-weight:700}.box{padding:15px;background:#f5f8f6;border-radius:14px;margin:12px 0}.drop{display:block;padding:28px;border:2px dashed #91aa9a;border-radius:16px;text-align:center}.drop input{display:none}.result{white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.6}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><div class="card"><h1>🦜 Bird ID</h1><p>ছবি দিয়ে AI-এর সাহায্যে পাখি শনাক্ত করুন। Guest Mode — registration/login লাগবে না।</p><div class="box">Scan Credit: <strong id="credits"><?=$u['credits']?></strong></div><a class="link" href="history.php">📚 Scan History</a><h3>Scan কিনুন</h3><button class="btn stripe" onclick="stripePay(1)">Stripe · 1 Scan — ৳<?=$PRICE_PER_SCAN?></button><button class="btn stripe" onclick="stripePay(5)">Stripe · 5 — ৳<?=$PRICE_PER_SCAN*5?></button><button class="btn stripe" onclick="stripePay(10)">Stripe · 10 — ৳<?=$PRICE_PER_SCAN*10?></button><br><button class="btn bkash" onclick="bkashPay(1)">bKash · 1 Scan — ৳<?=$PRICE_PER_SCAN?></button><button class="btn bkash" onclick="bkashPay(5)">bKash · 5 — ৳<?=$PRICE_PER_SCAN*5?></button><button class="btn bkash" onclick="bkashPay(10)">bKash · 10 — ৳<?=$PRICE_PER_SCAN*10?></button><p id="msg"></p><h3>পাখির ছবি</h3><label class="drop">📷 ছবি নির্বাচন করুন<input id="photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><button class="btn stripe" onclick="scan()">🔎 Scan Bird</button><div id="out" class="box result"></div><script>async function post(url,n){let f=new FormData();f.append('scans',n);let r=await fetch(url,{method:'POST',body:f});return r.json()}async function stripePay(n){let d=await post('stripe_checkout.php',n);if(d.checkout_url)location.href=d.checkout_url;else msg.textContent=d.error||'Stripe error'}async function bkashPay(n){let d=await post('bkash_create.php',n);if(d.checkout_url)location.href=d.checkout_url;else msg.textContent=d.error||'bKash error'}async function scan(){let p=photo.files[0];if(!p)return alert('ছবি দিন');let f=new FormData();f.append('photo',p);out.textContent='Analyzing...';let r=await fetch('analyze.php',{method:'POST',body:f});let d=await r.json();out.textContent=d.result||d.error;if(d.credits!==undefined)credits.textContent=d.credits}</script></div></main></body></html>
